# The mixer daemon, one per target triple, is a build artefact and not source.
# `cargo tauri build` refuses to run without the one for the host, so put it
# here first:
#
#   cargo build --release --bin godwinmix
#   cp target/release/godwinmix \
#      tauri-app/binaries/godwinmix-$(rustc -vV | sed -n 's/^host: //p')
#
# CI does the same, per platform, before it calls `cargo tauri build`.
godwinmix-*
!.gitignore
